          "settings": {
            "heading": "The afternoon problem.",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "text_KzehaY": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>A proper manicure still costs you an afternoon in a chair. Then it locks you into one look for weeks, grows out awkwardly at the base, and only comes off where it went on. Do it often enough and your nails thin, until the lamp begins to sting.</p><p>We didn't think the problem was the manicure. It was everything around it.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
