            "caption": "001",
            "heading": "One set at a time",
            "text": "<p>Handmade press-on nails — shaped, painted and finished one set at a time by nail artists, never stamped out by the thousand.</p><p>On with tabs in about ten minutes, off whenever you decide. No lamp, no drill, no acetone, no appointment.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        },
        "row_pFhMgG": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/e0ebcfd471dfd8a68c983f98b5795137.jpg",
            "caption": "002",
            "heading": "Hands, not lines",
            "text": "<p>Our nails are made by a small group of nail artists in China, most of whom work from home. It is deliberate: they set their own hours and stay with their families, and we get sets painted by people who chose this craft — not people assigned to a production line.</p><p>Every design is developed by our founder alongside them, which is how the standard stays the same whoever picks up the brush.</p>",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": ""
          }
        }
      },
